# Agent Execution Rules: Terminal-Only Fast Verification

에이전트 실행 규칙: 터미널 전용 고속 검증 (`AGENTS.md` / `GEMINI.md` / `.agents/rules/rules.md`)

## 1. Browser & Scratchpad Policy
- Do NOT launch Chrome, Scratchpad, or any browser for visual verification during standard code edits.
- No automatic screenshots after editing. Trust HMR on the user's browser.
- Exception only when user explicitly requests `/scratchpad`, `/action scratchpad`, or "scratchpad로 검증해줘".

## 2. Terminal-Based Error Verification
- After code changes, run quick static checks via terminal (no browser).
- TypeScript: `npx tsc --noEmit` / Next.js: `npm run lint` / JS: `node --check <file>.js` / Python: `python -m py_compile <file>.py`
- GAS / Apps Script (this project): syntax-check `Code.gs` and `index.html` inline scripts; Python helpers with `python -m py_compile`
- Do not run heavy builds/dev servers/long tests unless requested. Do not loop endlessly on non-critical lint warnings.

## 3. Workflow Optimization
- Apply code changes + fast terminal verification, then stop.
- Never auto `git commit` / `git push`. Wait for explicit `/git-commit`.

## 4. Git Commit & Push (only on `/git-commit`)
- Only when user sends `/git-commit`, `/action git-commit`, or explicit README-update-and-push request.
- Append KST dated history to README bottom (Date/Time, Commit Hash, Modification Details), then commit (Korean message) and push.

## 5. `/ask` Mode
- No source code changes. Answer simply, or write a plan to `c:\Users\user\Desktop\appsscript\25-timetable\.plan\YYYY-MM-DD_HHmm_<topic>.md` (with KST date & time in the filename).
- Never auto-execute the plan even if Auto-Approve is offered.

## 6. `/scratchpad` Mode
- Explicit exception to Rule 1. Use browser subagent for visual UI verification and report.

## 7. `/apply` Mode
- Immediately implement the latest plan file in `c:\Users\user\Desktop\appsscript\25-timetable\.plan\` without needing "반영해줘".
- Then Rule 2 verification. No auto commit/push.

## 8. `/impeccable` & `/impeccable-all`
- `/impeccable`: design quality detect, PRODUCT.md/DESIGN.md context, refine work.
- `/impeccable-all`: full 25-criteria scorecard → write plan to `.plan/YYYY-MM-DD_HHmm_impeccable_plan.md` and wait (no code changes).
- User runs `/apply` to implement the plan.

## Registered Skills (`.agents/skills/`)
- `/ask`, `/apply`, `/git-commit`, `/scratchpad`, `/impeccable`, `/impeccable-all`

